        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Prevent Termination",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Stops iOS from closing chosen apps, even when RAM is low. When you leave the app, it freezes completely with no CPU usage, staying right where you left off.\n\n*Battery Impact: Balanced (Uses more RAM)*",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Prevent Suspension",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Keeps selected apps running in the background constantly. Useful for keeping downloads, GPS tracking, and instant alerts active without keeping the app open on screen.\n\n*Battery Impact: High*",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Fast Freeze",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Pauses apps immediately the moment you leave them, skipping the standard iOS background delay. Cuts background battery usage and lets apps resume without reloading.\n\n*Battery Impact: Very Low*",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Prevent Termination + Fast Freeze",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Combines both modes: apps won't get closed by the system, but they freeze instantly when minimized to avoid draining power.\n\n*Battery Impact: Balanced*",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 16
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Extra Features",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Freeze Delay Slider",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Adjust how many seconds to wait before backgrounded apps freeze, giving brief tasks enough time to finish.",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "WhatsApp Notification Fix",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Increases the memory limit for WhatsApp's notification service to fix missing or delayed alerts.\n\n*Note: WhatsApp must have an active protection rule assigned in settings for notifications to work properly.*",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
